         "The double split yields 60/20/40... precisely 60% train, 20% validation, 20% test, stratified so each split keeps the class balance. random_state makes the split reproducible. The discipline: tune everything against validation, and evaluate on test once — if you iterate against test, it becomes validation by another name and your final number lies.",
